\header {
  texidoc = "
Comparison of rehearsalMarkFormatter functions.

The marks should read H, K, I, K, 93, XCVI, XCVJ, 8, AB, CC, Dd,
xcvi, xcvj, iij., boxed A, circled B, ovalled C, medium font D."
